WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.595
Find, filter and organise records using SQL.

00:00:04.595 --> 00:00:08.495
Filter with WHERE and sort the remaining rows with ORDER BY marks DESC.

00:00:09.495 --> 00:00:12.347
Which clause filters rows before grouping?

00:00:12.347 --> 00:00:15.675
WHERE filters individual rows; HAVING filters groups.
